    "scheme": "http",
    "port": 8093,
    "path": "/api/health"
  },
  "changelog": "1.0.0: initial release: Caddy-based reverse proxy with automatic Let's Encrypt certificates, per-domain routes to any host:port (including EthOS itself), WebSocket and streaming support, live certificate expiry, a DNS preflight check and the proxy log in one native EthOS window.",
